/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2003 StTriggerData2003

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 3 (year 2003) trigger data.

\section sec2003_overview Overview

StTriggerData2003 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 3 (year 2003)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TrgDataType2003 structure &mdash;
the in-memory image of the DAQ trigger bank written by the STAR Trigger Control Unit (TCU) &mdash;
and exposes its content through the common StTriggerData accessor API.

\section sec2003_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2003
\endcode

\section sec2003_runyear Run Year
Run 3, calendar year 2003 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 200 GeV.

\section sec2003_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TrgDataType2003* | Pointer to the raw Run 3 trigger bank in memory. |

\section sec2003_methods Methods

All public methods override the pure-virtual StTriggerData interface.  Detector subsystems
active in Run 3: BBC, CTB, MWC, FPD, ZDC (without SMD), BEMC (partial), EEMC.

Key method groups:
- Generic trigger info: token(), triggerWord(), actionWord(), version(), numberOfPreXing(), numberOfPostXing()
- Bunch/spin bits: bunchId48Bit(), bunchId7Bit(), spinBit(), spinBitYellow*(), spinBitBlue*()
- DSM hierarchy: bemcLayer1DSM(), eemcLayer1DSM(), emcLayer2DSM(), fpdLayer1DSMRaw(), fpdLayer2DSMRaw()
- CTB: ctbRaw(), ctb(), ctbTraySlat(), ctbSum()
- MWC: mwc()
- BBC: bbcADC(), bbcTDC(), bbcADCSum(), bbcADCSumLargeTile(), bbcEarliestTDC(), bbcTimeDifference()
- FPD: fpd(), fpdSum()
- ZDC: zdcAtChannel(), zdcAtAddress(), zdcUnAttenuated(), zdcAttenuated(), zdcADC(), zdcTDC(), zdcHardwareSum()
  <br><b>Note:</b> zdcSMD() is NOT available in this format (added in 2004).
- EMC: bemcHighTower(), bemcJetPatch(), eemcHighTower(), eemcJetPatch(), bemcHighestTowerADC(), eemcHighestTowerADC()
- Expert: getTriggerStructure(), getTriggerStructure2003(), getRawSize(), l2Result(), l2ResultLength()

getDsm0_BEMCE(), getDsm0_BEMCW(), and getDsm1_BEMC() return \c nullptr for this format.

\section sec2003_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short bbcEast = trgData->bbcEarliestTDC(east, 0);
    unsigned short zdcSum  = trgData->zdcHardwareSum(0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2004
*/
